	'The login screen can’t change an expired password. Press Ctrl+Alt+F1 and log in on the text screen, which asks for a new one.',
	'Web apps use a Firefox feature that Mozilla hasn’t turned on for Linux yet. A site that moves you to another address when you sign in (Teams does) may show in Software as not installed after you made its web app.',
